{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"746943458195013642","content":"Ok just on the topic of my main season character plan: looking at reborn from the ravenloft book coming up to be used with necrowizard with a single point life cleric.(classes may change with the book)\n\nBackstory: in a previous life he was a railroad builder and former sailor, he pushed through sweat and blood to finish the railways in and out of empire city. Eventually the exhaustion did him in. His last testament said to leave him where he lay and push on, but his employer decided he was still needed, forcing his reanimation to have him complete the work, overtime being around the others he pushed hard with in life and continuing the proud work he had caused the fragment of his soul ised to reanimate him gave new life, he was not totally reborn, his memory only faint, but his pride and drive were still there, giving way for a spark of life which pushed him to finish his railway and steal the spellbook of the one who raised him up again. Overtime he's learned to share the spark of life within him and animate others whose work was unfinished.","created_at":"2021-03-02T01:15:07.795000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"816116380394979369","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
